<BaseLayout title="Privacy" description="Privacy policy for the ZAO Fractal mobile app.">
  <h1>ZAO Fractal app privacy</h1>
  <p>The ZAO Fractal app does not collect, store or send any personal data.</p>
  <ul>
    <li>No account, no login and no wallet connection.</li>
    <li>No analytics, no ads and no tracking.</li>
    <li>Monday reminders are scheduled on your phone, by your phone. If you turn them off, they are gone. No server is involved.</li>
    <li>Leaderboard, votes and whitepaper text ship inside the app. They come from public records on OP Mainnet and from this site.</li>
    <li>Links to Discord, zao.frapps.xyz and block explorers open in your own browser or app. Those services have their own policies.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>Questions: <a href="mailto:info@thezao.com">info@thezao.com</a>.</p>
</BaseLayout>
